            "review_title": "Review at 8393 HaNoi",
            "review_text": "jc0sm3\nSeattle, Washington5 contributions\n0\nDelicious!\nJan 2018\nWe were in desperate need of sustenance when we found 8393 HaNoi. The outside of the restaurant was so welcoming we felt compelled to come in. We ordered a chicken banh mi & beef banh mi. They came very quickly were both Delicious!!! The flavors were great with very fresh ingredients. The best banh mis we had in 3 weeks of travel in Vietnam! We had a wonderful conversation with the Owner & wish her the very best of luck with 8393 HaNoi. This is our last day in Hanoi but we’ll definitely be back for one more great meal!\nRead more\nWritten January 13, 2018",
