            "review_title": "Review at 8393 HaNoi",
            "review_text": "S-STravels86\nLondon, United Kingdom99 contributions\n0\nMisleading menu long wait times.\nSep 2017 • Couples\nThis restaurant looked good from the outside as it was pretty full. We later found out it was due to the long wait times for food.\nI ordered a Hanoi beer but they had ran out. I got a Saigon instead. About 30mins later they ran out of beer altogether.\nI ordered grilled pork ribs and rice and they didn't have that either.\nI ended up ordering grilled pork on rice and my partner grilled chicken on rice.\nNo worries 15 minutes wait they said...40 mins later.\nMy partner ends up with chicken fried rice and my grilled pork on rice looks nothing like the menu, no eggs or gravy.\nThey credited the chicken fried rice off the bill. They really need to check the accuracy of their menu 'com rang' does not translate to grilled chicken.\nFood was decent enough but served warm not hot, especially after the long wait.\nDecent prices but will not return.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 26, 2017",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
