            "review_text": "shahab111\n11 contributions\n0\nRip us off with order and got gastro\nAug 2017 • Couples\nAvoid this place. We stopped by for take away as only joint opened in the street. Ordered take away and only got half of what we ordered and paid for. Gastro all day the following day!\nWritten August 25, 2017\nthuy n\nhello! i'm the owner of 8393 HaNoi. First i have to say i'm very sorry for what you have been experienced in our place and thank you so much for your review, we very priciate that! And in order to have a better services do you mind give me the time, your order and the number of money you have paid for us. Sorry for my mistake but are you a young couple come very late that day and you ordered 2pieces of springrolls and 1 fries? if it's true so i have to say that my staff already told you about the price before you order, i'm there too and i am the person bring you the food. The price for 2 pieces of springrolls are 20.000vnd and 1 fries is 30.000vnd, and you only paid 50.000vnd and get eveythings you have ordered. we can check the security camera to make sure that there is no such thing that you have to paid double for a half order. Thank you so much, if you have any review please feel free to let us know, thanks again.\nRead more\nWritten August 26, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
